    {
      "name": "Artisan's Toolkit",
      "quantity": 1,
      "description": "<p>You need these tools to create items from raw materials with the Craft skill. Different sets are needed for different work, as determined by the GM; for example, a blacksmith's toolkit differs from a woodworker's toolkit. If you wear your artisan's toolkit, you can draw and replace it as part of the action that uses it.</p>",
